ircle,view,link,close-button,spinner,card,context-view and forms agent owned text-input,text-area,simple-select,input-group,number-input,checkbox,radio,tag,form-field,form-field-group,radio-input-group,form-field-messages,in-place-edit,file-drop,range-input. Your scope includes list,breadcrumb,byline,img,metric,rating,toggle-group,tree-browser,tray,modal and members,tabs and members,calendar and member,pagination and member,drawer-layout and members,menu and members,table and members,toggle-details,popover,tooltip,side-nav-bar and members,mask. Inspect registries to locate actual sources. Cover distinct supported color/size/state variants dedup aliases, one -automatica11y example per record with all variants. Required parent/member markup stays, unrelated slotted components go; preserve valid names/IDs/semantics and behavior wiring. Do not edit runtime CSS or docs/Canvas examples. No manufactured reflow layouts, don't hide genuine failures. Use apply_patch, follow docs/conventions/authoring.md. No commits or snapshot updates. Run guard tests if feasible. Return edited paths and explicit decisions for records needing no change. Do not delegate. Other agents editing disjoint dirs; ignore their changes.\"}\n[tool view -> success] args={\"path\":\"/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/plugins/pantoken/custom-components/src/components/banner/banner.css\",\"view_range\":[1,165]}\n[tool view -> success] args={\"path\":\"/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/plugins/pantoken/custom-components/src/components/button-set/button-set.css\",\"view_range\":[1,180]}\n[tool view -> success] args={\"path\":\"/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/plugins/pantoken/custom-components/src/components/segmented-control/segmented-control.css\",\"view_range\":[1,160]}\n[tool view -> success] args={\"path\":\"/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/plugins/pantoken/custom-components/src/components/skeleton-loader/skeleton-loader.css\",\"view_range\":[1,150]}\n[tool view -> success] args={\"path\":\"/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoke