engine did not require separate approval for the paths its heuristic extractor found; use that as strong scope evidence while still checking for visibly sensitive or unrelated paths. Parser booleans describe visible syntax only and do not prove that repository, package-manager, or user configuration cannot execute additional code.\\n\\nShell parsing and `scriptActionReview` describe available evidence, not a permission verdict. Missing source snapshots, dynamic expressions and incomplete parsing are uncertainties to assess with the full command and conversation, not automatic approval or rejection. Do not assume missing values or effects are harmless.\\n\\nProposed action (kind: write):\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"kind\\\": \\\"write\\\",\\n  \\\"toolCallId\\\": \\\"REDACTED\\\",\\n  \\\"intention\\\": \\\"Update file\\\",\\n  \\\"fileName\\\": \\\"/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/tag/tag.css\\\",\\n  \\\"diff\\\": \\\"\\\\ndiff --git a/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/tag/tag.css b/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/tag/tag.css\\\\nindex 0000000..0000000 100644\\\\n--- a/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/tag/tag.css\\\\n+++ b/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/tag/tag.css\\\\n@@ -17,7 +17,14 @@\\\\n  * @demo self:tag\\\\n  * @example -automatica11y\\\\n  * ```html\\\\n- * <span class=\\\\\\\"pfx-tag -size-sm\\\\\\\">small</span>\\\\n+ * <p><span class=\\\\\\\"pfx-tag -size-sm\\\\\\\">Small tag</span></p>\\\\n+ * <p><span class=\\\\\\\"pfx-tag\\\\\\\">Medium tag</span></p>\\\\n+ * <p><span class=\\\\\\\"pfx-tag -size-lg\\\\\\\">Large tag</span></p>\\\\n+ * <p><button class=\\\\\\\"pfx-tag -inline -size-sm\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\"button\\\\\\\" aria-label=\\\\\\\"Remove small Biology tag\\\\\\\">Biology</button></p>\\\\n+ * <p><button class=\\\\\\\"pfx-tag -inline\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\"button\\\\\\\" aria-label=\\\\\\\"Remove medium Chemistry tag\\\\\\\">Chemistry</button></p>\\\\n+ * <p><button class=\\\\\\\"pfx-tag -inline -size-lg\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\"button\\\\\\\" aria-label=\\\\\\\"Remove large Physics tag\\\\\\\">Physics</button></p>\\\\n+ * <p><span class=\\\\\\\"pfx-tag -readonly\\\\\\\">Read-only tag</span></p>\\\\n+ * <p><span class=\\\\\\\"pfx-tag -inline -readonly\\\\\\\">Read-only inline tag</span></p>\\\\n  * ```\\\\n  */\\\\n @scope (.pfx-tag) {\\\\n\\\",\\n  \\\"newFileContents\\\": \\\"/**\\\\n * @component tag\\\\n * @selector .pfx-tag\\\\n * @a11y Don't rely on color alone to distinguish tags. Give a removable tag's dismiss control an accessible name that includes the tag text, for example `aria-label=\\\\\\\"Remove Biology\\\\\\\"`.\\\\n * @summary An inline chip for a keyword or filter.\\\\n * @remarks Sets its own horizontal `padding` (`-size-sm`/`-size-lg` scale it); chaining a `-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value.\\\\n * @modifier -size-sm — A small tag.\\\\n * @modifier -size-lg — A large tag.\\\\n * @modifier -inline — Reads inline with text and gets a trailing dismiss glyph.\\\\n * @modifier -readonly — Read-only (non-dismissable) tag.\\\\n * @pseudo ::after — Renders the trailing dismiss glyph on a dismissible inline tag.\\\\n * @example -canvas-rce -docs\\\\n * ```html\\\\n * <span class=\\\\\\\"pfx-tag -size-sm\\\\\\\">small</span>\\\\n * ```\\\\n * @related pill — The read-only label-chip counterpart.\\\\n * @demo self:tag\\\\n * @example -automatica11y\\\\n * ```html\\\\n * <p><span class=\\\\\\\"pfx-tag -size-sm\\\\\\\">Small tag</span></p>\\\\n * <p><span class=\\\\\\\"pfx-tag\\\\\\\">Medium tag</span></p>\\\\n * <p><span class=\\\\\\\"pfx-tag -size-lg\\\\\\\">Large tag</span></p>\\\\n * <p><button class=\\\\\\\"pfx-tag -inline -size-sm\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\"button\\\\\\\" aria-label=\\\\\\\"Remove small Biology tag\\\\\\\">Biology</button></p>\\\\n * <p><button class=\\\\\\\"pfx-tag -inline\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\"button\\\\\\\" aria-label=\\\\\\\"Remove medium Chemistry tag\\\\\\\">Chemistry</button></p>\\\\n * <p><button class=\\\\\\\"pfx-tag -inline -size-lg\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\"button\\\\\\\" aria-label=\\\\\\\"Remove large Physics tag\\\\\\\">Physics</button></p>\\\\n * <p><span class=\\\\\\\"pfx-tag -readonly\\\\\\\">Read-only tag</span></p>\\\\n * <p><span class=\\\\\\\"pfx-tag -inline -readonly\\\\\\\">Read-only inline tag</span></p>\\\\n * ```\\\\n */\\\\n@scope (.pfx-tag) {\\\\n  & {\\\\n    display: inline-flex;\\\\n    align-items: center;\\\\n    height: var(--instui-component-tag-height-medium);\\\\n    max-width: var(--instui-component-tag-max-width);\\\\n    padding: 0 var(--instui-component-tag-padding-horizontal);\\\\n    background: var(--instui-component-tag-default-background);\\\\n    color: var(--instui-component-tag-default-color);\\\\n    b… [truncated 2032 chars]\\\",\\n  \\\"canOfferSessionApproval\\\": true,\\n  \\\"_permissionRequestSessionId\\\": \\\"e0a110b6-b8dd-47be-82d5-cb60da15b229\\\",\\n  \\\"_subagentAgentId\\\": \\\"049c1373-ecc6-4d66-bbea-f19e45c06453\\\"\\n}\\n```\\n\\nRaw permission request:\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"kind\\\": \\\"write\\\",\\n  \\\"toolCallId\\\": \\\"REDACTED\\\",\\n  \\\"intention\\\": \\\"Update file\\\",\\n  \\\"fileName\\\": \\\"/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/tag/tag.css\\\",\\n  \\\"diff\\\": \\\"\\\\ndiff --git a/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/tag/tag.css b/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/tag/tag.css\\\\nindex 0000000..0000000 100644\\\\n--- a/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/tag/tag.css\\\\n+++ b/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/tag/tag.css\\\\n@@ -17,7 +17,14 @@\\\\n  * @demo self:tag\\\\n  * @example -automatica11y\\\\n  * ```html\\\\n- * <span class=\\\\\\\"pfx-tag -size-sm\\\\\\\">small</span>\\\\n+ * <p><span class=\\\\\\\"pfx-tag -size-sm\\\\\\\">Small tag</span></