{"type":"permission.requested","data":{"requestId":"c8aea06c-d820-4237-bb48-911364f758cd","permissionRequest":{"kind":"write","toolCallId":"custom_call_vwFQwv2RaBOfkTL8HzNp5qrH","intention":"Update file","fileName":"/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/tag/tag.css","diff":"\ndiff --git a/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/tag/tag.css b/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/tag/tag.css\nindex 0000000..0000000 100644\n--- a/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/tag/tag.css\n+++ b/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/tag/tag.css\n@@ -17,7 +17,14 @@\n  * @demo self:tag\n  * @example -automatica11y\n  * ```html\n- * <span class=\"pfx-tag -size-sm\">small</span>\n+ * <p><span class=\"pfx-tag -size-sm\">Small tag</span></p>\n+ * <p><span class=\"pfx-tag\">Medium tag</span></p>\n+ * <p><span class=\"pfx-tag -size-lg\">Large tag</span></p>\n+ * <p><button class=\"pfx-tag -inline -size-sm\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Remove small Biology tag\">Biology</button></p>\n+ * <p><button class=\"pfx-tag -inline\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Remove medium Chemistry tag\">Chemistry</button></p>\n+ * <p><button class=\"pfx-tag -inline -size-lg\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Remove large Physics tag\">Physics</button></p>\n+ * <p><span class=\"pfx-tag -readonly\">Read-only tag</span></p>\n+ * <p><span class=\"pfx-tag -inline -readonly\">Read-only inline tag</span></p>\n  * ```\n  */\n @scope (.pfx-tag) {\n","newFileContents":"/**\n * @component tag\n * @selector .pfx-tag\n * @a11y Don't rely on color alone to distinguish tags. Give a removable tag's dismiss control an accessible name that includes the tag text, for example `aria-label=\"Remove Biology\"`.\n * @summary An inline chip for a keyword or filter.\n * @remarks Sets its own horizontal `padding` (`-size-sm`/`-size-lg` scale it); chaining a `-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value.\n * @modifier -size-sm — A small tag.\n * @modifier -size-lg — A large tag.\n * @modifier -inline — Reads inline with text and gets a trailing dismiss glyph.\n * @modifier -readonly — Read-only (non-dismissable) tag.\n * @pseudo ::after — Renders the trailing dismiss glyph on a dismissible inline tag.\n * @example -canvas-rce -docs\n * ```html\n * <span class=\"pfx-tag -size-sm\">small</span>\n * ```\n * @related pill — The read-only label-chip counterpart.\n * @demo self:tag\n * @example -automatica11y\n * ```html\n * <p><span class=\"pfx-tag -size-sm\">Small tag</span></p>\n * <p><span class=\"pfx-tag\">Medium tag</span></p>\n * <p><span class=\"pfx-tag -size-lg\">Large tag</span></p>\n * <p><button class=\"pfx-tag -inline -size-sm\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Remove small Biology tag\">Biology</button></p>\n * <p><button class=\"pfx-tag -inline\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Remove medium Chemistry tag\">Chemistry</button></p>\n * <p><button class=\"pfx-tag -inline -size-lg\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Remove large Physics tag\">Physics</button></p>\n * <p><span class=\"pfx-tag -readonly\">Read-only tag</span></p>\n * <p><span class=\"pfx-tag -inline -readonly\">Read-only inline tag</span></p>\n * ```\n */\n@scope (.pfx-tag) {\n  & {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    height: var(--instui-component-tag-height-medium);\n    max-width: var(--instui-component-tag-max-width);\n    padding: 0 var(--instui-component-tag-padding-horizontal);\n    background: var(--instui-component-tag-default-background);\n    color: var(--instui-component-tag-default-color);\n    border: var(--instui-component-tag-default-border-width)\n      var(--instui-component-tag-default-border-style)\n      var(--instui-component-tag-default-border-color);\n    border-radius: var(--instui-component-tag-default-border-radius);\n    font-family: var(--instui-component-tag-font-family);\n    font-size: var(--instui-component-tag-font-size-medium);\n  }\n\n  &:hover {\n    background: var(--instui-component-tag-default-background-hover);\n  }\n\n  &.-size-sm {\n    height: var(--instui-component-tag-height-small);\n    padding: 0 var(--instui-component-tag-padding-horizontal-small);\n    font-size: var(--instui-component-tag-font-size-small);\n  }\n\n  &.-size-lg {\n    height: var(--instui-component-tag-height-large);\n    font-size: var(--instui-component-tag-font-size-large);\n  }\n\n  &.-inline {\n    gap: var(--instui-spacing-space-xs);\n    background: var(--instui-component-tag-inline-background);\n    color: var(--instui-component-tag-inline-color);\n    border-color: var(--instui-component-tag-inline-border-color);\n    border-radius: var(--instui-component-tag-inline-border-radius);\n    cursor: pointer;\n  }\n\n  &.-inline:hover {\n    background: var(--instui-component-tag-inline-background-hover);\n  }\n\n  &.-inline::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    flex: none;\n    width: 1em;\n    height: 1em;\n    background: var(--instui-component-tag-inline-icon-color);\n    -webkit-mask: var(--instui-icon-x) center / contain no-repeat;\n    mask: var(--instui-icon-x) center / contain no-repeat;\n  }\n\n  &.-inline:hover::after {\n    background: var(--instui-component-tag-inline-icon-hover-color);\n  }\n\n  @media (forced-colors: active) {\n    &.-inline::after,\n    &.-inline:hover::after {\n      forced-color-adjust: preserve-parent-color;\n      background: currentColor;\n    }\n  }\n\n  /* readOnly (InstUI): a static tag — no hover affordance, and the dismiss glyph is dropped. */\n  &.-readonly {\n    cursor: default;\n    background: var(--instui-component-tag-default-background);\n  }\n\n  &.-readonly.-inline::after {\n    display: none;\n  }\n}\n","canOfferSessionApproval":true,"fileEdits":[{"before":{"path":"/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/tag/tag.css","content":"/**\n * @component tag\n * @selector .pfx-tag\n * @a11y Don't rely on color alone to distinguish tags. Give a removable tag's dismiss control an accessible name that includes the tag text, for example `aria-label=\"Remove Biology\"`.\n * @summary An inline chip for a keyword or filter.\n * @remarks Sets its own horizontal `padding` (`-size-sm`/`-size-lg` scale it); chaining a `-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value.\n * @modifier -size-sm — A small tag.\n * @modifier -size-lg — A large tag.\n * @modifier -inline — Reads inline with text and gets a trailing dismiss glyph.\n * @modifier -readonly — Read-only (non-dismissable) tag.\n * @pseudo ::after — Renders the trailing dismiss glyph on a dismissible inline tag.\n * @example -canvas-rce -docs\n * ```html\n * <span class=\"pfx-tag -size-sm\">small</span>\n * ```\n * @related pill — The read-only label-chip counterpart.\n * @demo self:tag\n * @example -automatica11y\n * ```html\n * <span class=\"pfx-tag -size-sm\">small</span>\n * ```\n */\n@scope (.pfx-tag) {\n  & {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    height: var(--instui-component-tag-height-medium);\n    max-width: var(--instui-component-tag-max-width);\n    padding: 0 var(--instui-component-tag-padding-horizontal);\n    background: var(--instui-component-tag-default-background);\n    color: var(--instui-component-tag-default-color);\n    border: var(--instui-component-tag-default-border-width)\n      var(--instui-component-tag-default-border-style)\n      var(--instui-component-tag-default-border-color);\n    border-radius: var(--instui-component-tag-default-border-radius);\n    font-family: var(--instui-component-tag-font-family);\n    font-size: var(--instui-component-tag-font-size-medium);\n  }\n\n  &:hover {\n    background: var(--instui-component-tag-default-background-hover);\n  }\n\n  &.-size-sm {\n    height: var(--instui-component-tag-height-small);\n    padding: 0 var(--instui-component-tag-padding-horizontal-small);\n    font-size: var(--instui-component-tag-font-size-small);\n  }\n\n  &.-size-lg {\n    height: var(--instui-component-tag-height-large);\n    font-size: var(--instui-component-tag-font-size-large);\n  }\n\n  &.-inline {\n    gap: var(--instui-spacing-space-xs);\n    background: var(--instui-component-tag-inline-background);\n    color: var(--instui-component-tag-inline-color);\n    border-color: var(--instui-component-tag-inline-border-color);\n    border-radius: var(--instui-component-tag-inline-border-radius);\n    cursor: pointer;\n  }\n\n  &.-inline:hover {\n    background: var(--instui-component-tag-inline-background-hover);\n  }\n\n  &.-inline::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    flex: none;\n    width: 1em;\n    height: 1em;\n    background: var(--instui-component-tag-inline-icon-color);\n    -webkit-mask: var(--instui-icon-x) center / contain no-repeat;\n    mask: var(--instui-icon-x) center / contain no-repeat;\n  }\n\n  &.-inline:hover::after {\n    background: var(--instui-component-tag-inline-icon-hover-color);\n  }\n\n  @media (forced-colors: active) {\n    &.-inline::after,\n    &.-inline:hover::after {\n      forced-color-adjust: preserve-parent-color;\n      background: currentColor;\n    }\n  }\n\n  /* readOnly (InstUI): a static tag — no hover affordance, and the dismiss glyph is dropped. */\n  &.-readonly {\n    cursor: default;\n    background: var(--instui-component-tag-default-background);\n  }\n\n  &.-readonly.-inline::after {\n    display: none;\n  }\n}\n"},"after":{"path":"/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/tag/tag.css","content":"/**\n * @component tag\n * @selector .pfx-tag\n * @a11y Don't rely on color alone to distinguish tags. Give a removable tag's dismiss control an accessible name that includes the tag text, for example `aria-label=\"Remove Biology\"`.\n * @summary An inline chip for a keyword or filter.\n * @remarks Sets its own horizontal `padding` (`-size-sm`/`-size-lg` scale it); chaining a `-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value.\n * @modifier -size-sm — A small tag.\n * @modifier -size-lg — A large tag.\n * @modifier -inline — Reads inline with text and gets a trailing dismiss glyph.\n * @modifier -readonly — Read-only (non-dismissable) tag.\n * @pseudo ::after — Renders the trailing dismiss glyph on a dismissible inline tag.\n * @example -canvas-rce -docs\n * ```html\n * <span class=\"pfx-tag -size-sm\">small</span>\n * ```\n * @related pill — The read-only label-chip counterpart.\n * @demo self:tag\n * @example -automatica11y\n * ```html\n * <p><span class=\"pfx-tag -size-sm\">Small tag</span></p>\n * <p><span class=\"pfx-tag\">Medium tag</span></p>\n * <p><span class=\"pfx-tag -size-lg\">Large tag</span></p>\n * <p><button class=\"pfx-tag -inline -size-sm\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Remove small Biology tag\">Biology</button></p>\n * <p><button class=\"pfx-tag -inline\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Remove medium Chemistry tag\">Chemistry</button></p>\n * <p><button class=\"pfx-tag -inline -size-lg\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Remove large Physics tag\">Physics</button></p>\n * <p><span class=\"pfx-tag -readonly\">Read-only tag</span></p>\n * <p><span class=\"pfx-tag -inline -readonly\">Read-only inline tag</span></p>\n * ```\n */\n@scope (.pfx-tag) {\n  & {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    height: var(--instui-component-tag-height-medium);\n    max-width: var(--instui-component-tag-max-width);\n    padding: 0 var(--instui-component-tag-padding-horizontal);\n    background: var(--instui-component-tag-default-background);\n    color: var(--instui-component-tag-default-color);\n    border: var(--instui-component-tag-default-border-width)\n      var(--instui-component-tag-default-border-style)\n      var(--instui-component-tag-default-border-color);\n    border-radius: var(--instui-component-tag-default-border-radius);\n    font-family: var(--instui-component-tag-font-family);\n    font-size: var(--instui-component-tag-font-size-medium);\n  }\n\n  &:hover {\n    background: var(--instui-c