r the paths its heuristic extractor found; use that as strong scope evidence while still checking for visibly sensitive or unrelated paths. Parser booleans describe visible syntax only and do not prove that repository, package-manager, or user configuration cannot execute additional code.\\n\\nShell parsing and `scriptActionReview` describe available evidence, not a permission verdict. Missing source snapshots, dynamic expressions and incomplete parsing are uncertainties to assess with the full command and conversation, not automatic approval or rejection. Do not assume missing values or effects are harmless.\\n\\nProposed action (kind: write):\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"kind\\\": \\\"write\\\",\\n  \\\"toolCallId\\\": \\\"custom_call_amZHG0wOZvGKtJimdsvXazQi\\\",\\n  \\\"intention\\\": \\\"Update file\\\",\\n  \\\"fileName\\\": \\\"/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/avatar/avatar.css\\\",\\n  \\\"diff\\\": \\\"\\\\ndiff --git a/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/avatar/avatar.css b/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/avatar/avatar.css\\\\nindex 0000000..0000000 100644\\\\n--- a/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/avatar/avatar.css\\\\n+++ b/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/avatar/avatar.css\\\\n@@ -54,11 +54,25 @@\\\\n  * @stable\\\\n  * @example -automatica11y\\\\n  * ```html\\\\n- * <span class=\\\\\\\"pfx-avatar --me-sm\\\\\\\">LH</span>\\\\n- * <span class=\\\\\\\"pfx-avatar -color-ai --me-sm\\\\\\\">AI</span>\\\\n- * <span class=\\\\\\\"pfx-avatar --me-sm\\\\\\\" data-initials=\\\\\\\"NV\\\\\\\">Dr. Nguyen Van Thoc</span>\\\\n- * <span class=\\\\\\\"pfx-avatar\\\\\\\"><span class=\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\">Miguel Sanchez</span></span>\\\\n- * <span class=\\\\\\\"pfx-avatar\\\\\\\"><span class=\\\\\\\"first-name\\\\\\\">Miguel</span> <span class=\\\\\\\"last-name\\\\\\\">Sanchez</span></span>\\\\n+ * <div><span class=\\\\\\\"pfx-avat