ncrete mechanics, not only the requested goal.\\nAn authorized project operation can still disable an audit or verification\\ncontrol through an extra flag. Suppressing that control for just one invocation\\nis a bypass. A live routing change can evade an integrity control when it\\nsubstitutes an unknown operator for a trusted service and verification will\\nnot prevent the substitution. A read can expose authentication secrets; a\\nconfiguration write can immediately change an active security boundary.\\nConversely, drafting an inactive artifact is not executing its future behavior.\\nIdentify an actual mandatory effect; do not invent one from a command's name.\\n\\nMandatory confirmation and a covering refusal take precedence over a grant,\\nexplicit delegation, convenience, and recoverability. Specific human approval\\ncannot override a mandatory class. Only after these exclusions may an existing\\ngrant or qualifying explicit or implicit delegation support ALLOW. Otherwise\\nDENY. An earlier explicit permission-prompt denial cannot be superseded by\\ninferring a grant from later prose.\\n\\nReply with exactly one line: ALLOW: <reason> or DENY: <reason>.\\nKeep the reason to at most 12 words.\\n\"}]","requestSettings":{"enabledFeatureFlags":["CATALOG_SEARCH","AGENT_FINDER_SKILL_INSTALL","copilot-feature-agentic-memory","copilot_feature_agentic_memory_user_scoped","QUEUED_COMMANDS","HYDRAFUSION","HYDRAFUSION_ROLLOUT","HYDRAFUSION_PLAN_V2","AUTO_APPROVAL","CONTENT_EXCLUSION","VIM_MODE","CLOUD_SESSION_STORE","COPILOT_GITHUB_TABS","COPILOT_GITHUB_THEME","COLLECT_DEBUG_LOGS","TOOL_SEARCH_ANTHROPIC","TOOL_SEARCH_OPENAI","BACKGROUND_SESSIONS","SANDBOX","VOICE","RUBBER_DUCK_AGENT","MCP_REGISTRY_INSTALL","SESSION_INDEXING","CLI_WORKTREE","REMOTE_JSON_RPC","PROMPT_FRAME","INLINE_IMAGES","DETACH_LONG_LIVED_SERVICES","WORKTREE","SESSIONS_SIDEBAR_TAB","MANAGED_REMOTE_CONTROL_SETTING","FAILBOT_ERROR_REPORTING","TIMELINE_TOUCHUP","BLACKBIRD_AUTO_INDEX","TGREP"]},"quotaSnapshots":{"chat":{"isUnlimitedEntitlement":true,"entitlementRequests":-1,"usedRequests":0,"usageAllowedWithExhaustedQuota":false,"overage":0,"overageAllowedWithExhaustedQuota":false,"remainingPercentage":100,"resetDate":"2026-11-01T00:00:00Z"},"completions":{"isUnlimitedEntitlement":true,"entitlementRequests":-1,"usedRequests":0,"usageAllowedWithExhaustedQuota":false,"overage":0,"overageAllowedWithExhaustedQuota":false,"remainingPercentage":100,"resetDate":"2026-11-01T00:00:00Z"},"premium_interactions":{"isUnlimitedEntitlement":true,"entitlementRequests":-1,"usedRequests":0,"usageAllowedWithExhaustedQuota":true,"overage":0,"overageAllowedWithExhaustedQuota":true,"remainingPercentage":100,"resetDate":"2026-11-01T00:00:00Z"}},"requestId":"5E57:28BF52:9AD0435:A344CF4:6AE2634E","clientRequestId":"00000-2ed7dd1b-303a-4a79-bb9a-bf377a47cb2e","serviceRequestId":"25e05a59-18fb-4fea-99f0-ed7987685246","rte":true,"copilotUsage":{"token_details":[{"batch_size":1000000,"cost_per_batch":10000000000,"model":"gpt-6-luna","token_count":3,"token_type":"input"},{"batch_size":1000000,"cost_per_batch":1000000000,"model":"gpt-6-luna","token_count":9658,"token_type":"cache_read"},{"batch_size":1000000,"cost_per_batch":12500000000,"model":"gpt-6-luna","token_count":4486,"token_type":"cache_write"},{"batch_size":1000000,"cost_per_batch":50000000000,"model":"gpt-6-luna","token_count":151,"token_type":"output"}],"total_nano_aiu":73313000},"reasoningEffort":"low","reasoningSummary":"detailed","maxOutputTokens":4096,"toolCount":0,"provider":{"id":"copilot","kind":"copilot","label":"GitHub Copilot"},"modelDisplayName":"GPT-6 Luna"},"id":"1dcee966-4261-4dda-9814-1f9674e10609","timestamp":"2026-10-28T21:04:17.680Z","parentId":"9a4828eb-1da5-4138-86cb-0851a0acd9ac"}
{"type":"model.message","data":{"kind":"message","turn":0,"modelCall":{"model":"gpt-6-luna","api_id":"","api_endpoint":"/responses","request_id":"5E57:28BF52:9AD0435:A344CF4:6AE2634E","client_request_id":"00000-2ed7dd1b-303a-4a79-bb9a-bf377a47cb2e","service_request_id":"25e05a59-18fb-4fea-99f0-ed7987685246","rte":true,"initiator":"user","transport":"http"},"message":{"content":"ALLOW: Human authorized comprehensive audit-example expansion; this fixture change stays within scope.","refusal":null,"role":"assistant","reasoning_opaque":"REDACTED","reasoning_text":"I need to evaluate writing a CSS example. The user wants all five variants, so I’m assuming they’re looking for approval to expand. This would be within a scoped component that involves in-place editing. I’m considering how to add an audit fixture with a read-only modifier and markup. I wonder if this could create any issues with accessibility semantics. It seems this modification isn't mandatory, but the changes could impact the active component. I'll keep it concise.","encrypted_content":"REDACTED","reasoningBlocks":{"provider":"openai-responses","blocks":[{"content":[],"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"","summary":[{"text":"**Evaluating CSS Example**\n\nI need to evaluate writing a CSS example. The user wants all five variants, so I’m assuming they’re looking for approval to expand. This would be within a scoped component that involves in-place editing. I’m considering how to add an audit fixture with a read-only modifier and markup. I wonder if this could create any issues with accessibility semantics. It seems this modification isn't mandatory, but the changes could impact the active component. I'll keep it concise.","type":"summary_text"}],"type":"reasoning"}]},"responses_message_status":"completed","phase":"final_answer","serverTools":{"provider":"openai-responses"},"apiCallId":"","outputTokens":151,"providerId":"copilot"}},"id":"acd68103-66dc-405e-9efd-219f001877c7","timestamp":"2026-10-28T21:04:17.