{"type":"model.response","data":{"kind":"response","turn":0,"modelCall":{"model":"gpt-6-luna","api_id":""},"response":{"content":"ALLOW: Human authorized comprehensive audit-example expansion; this fixture change stays within scope.","refusal":null,"role":"assistant","reasoning_opaque":"REDACTED","reasoning_text":"I need to evaluate writing a CSS example. The user wants all five variants, so I’m assuming they’re looking for approval to expand. This would be within a scoped component that involves in-place editing. I’m considering how to add an audit fixture with a read-only modifier and markup. I wonder if this could create any issues with accessibility semantics. It seems this modification isn't mandatory, but the changes could impact the active component. I'll keep it concise.","encrypted_content":"REDACTED","reasoningBlocks":{"provider":"openai-responses","blocks":[{"content":[],"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"","summary":[{"text":"**Evaluating CSS Example**\n\nI need to evaluate writing a CSS example. The user wants all five variants, so I’m assuming they’re looking for approval to expand. This would be within a scoped component that involves in-place editing. I’m considering how to add an audit fixture with a read-only modifier and markup. I wonder if this could create any issues with accessibility semantics. It seems this modification isn't mandatory, but the changes could impact the active component. I'll keep it concise.","type":"summary_text"}],"type":"reasoning"}]},"responses_message_status":"completed","phase":"final_answer","serverTools":{"provider":"openai-responses"},"providerId":"copilot"}},"id":"0dfc9b05-00c4-4011-a5a4-00ecd12704f9","timestamp":"2026-10-28T21:04:17.681Z","parentId":"acd68103-66dc-405e-9efd-219f001877c7"}
