{"type":"assistant.message","data":{"messageId":"15fd3beb-45f4-40ff-a83e-a494d639dc3c","originatingMessageId":"bcd6040b-10b8-4ff3-bf41-ae8ad68fe12c","model":"gpt-6.1-sol","providerId":"copilot","content":"","toolRequests":[{"toolCallId":"call_7ENAZ5ZPwHsfUHr7zRF1eFL7","name":"write_agent","arguments":{"agent_ids":["049c1373-ecc6-4d66-bbea-f19e45c06453","78631379-5bbe-4a0d-a590-18491ff526c0","13128f82-ab9e-41de-a14e-bd6978da289e"],"message":"Parsed CssDocEntry.modifiers carries modifier.alias.canonical (not description @alias) and modifier.pattern. I'll add metadata-derived guard that requires canonical visual color/size/variant/state modifier classes on matching component roots, skipping aliases/patterns. Flag any intentional exceptions with rationale. Please ensure data-a11y roots/triggers remain where harness needs them; root identifiers should remain unique. Guard tests now normalize pfx before checking IDs/ARIA for plugin records too."},"type":"function"}],"interactionId":"e6fd8893-4785-4c46-92ed-ef8ea873a902","turnId":"22","reasoningOpaque":"REDACTED","reasoningText":"**Clarifying alias and testing details**\n\nI need to include all visual test records after the agents make their necessary adjustments. It's important to have explicit aliases, but I shouldn't deduplicate them. Since CSS aliases and deprecated fields are tricky, I have to be careful with those. I'll also need to dynamically classify pattern filters for all visual modifiers using regex to get sizes right. Finally, I should inform the agents about the planned test's scope.","encryptedContent":"","rte":true,"apiCallId":"","reasoningBlocks":{"provider":"openai-responses","blocks":[{"content":[],"encrypted_content":"","id":"","summary":[{"text":"**Clarifying alias and testing details**\n\nI need to include all visual test records after the agents make their necessary adjustments. It's important to have explicit aliases, but I shouldn't deduplicate them. Since CSS aliases and deprecated fields are tricky, I have to be careful with those. I'll also need to dynamically classify pattern filters for all visual modifiers using regex to get sizes right. Finally, I should inform the agents about the planned test's scope.","type":"summary_text"}],"type":"reasoning"}]}},"id":"fec5b455-e6cf-4e26-977c-75f2fbc5292e","timestamp":"2026-10-28T21:04:17.683Z","parentId":"84b2e568-3f26-4cc4-bd98-f98aa93e3197"}
{"type":"permission.requested","data":{"requestId":"df47a9ab-321d-4eac-b9f2-6054d2aa33d1","permissionRequest":{"kind":"write","toolCallId":"custom_call_vwFQwv2RaBOfkTL8HzNp5qrH","intention":"Update file","fileName":"/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/in-place-edit/in-place-edit.css","diff":"\ndiff --git a/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/in-place-edit/in-place-edit.css b/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/in-place-edit/in-place-edit.css\nindex 0000000..0000000 100644\n--- a/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/in-place-edit/in-place-edit.css\n+++ b/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/in-place-edit/in-place-edit.css\n@@ -13,7 +13,8 @@\n  * @demo self:in-place-edit\n  * @example -automatica11y\n  * ```html\n- * <span class=\"pfx-in-place-edit\" contenteditable=\"true\" role=\"textbox\" aria-label=\"Project name\">Untitled</span>\n+ * <p><span id=\"audit-project-label\">Project name</span>: <span class=\"pfx-in-place-edit\" contenteditable=\"true\" role=\"textbox\" aria-labelledby=\"audit-project-label\">Untitled</span></p>\n+ * <p><span id=\"audit-project-locked-label\">Locked project name</span>: <span class=\"pfx-in-place-edit -readonly\" contenteditable=\"false\" role=\"textbox\" aria-readonly=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"audit-project-locked-label\">Published project</span></p>\n  * ```\n  */\n @scope (.pfx-in-place-edit) {\n","newFileContents":"/**\n * @component in-place-edit\n * @selector .pfx-in-place-edit\n * @summary A [contenteditable] that reads as text until focused, then shows input chrome.\n * @remarks The input chrome only appears while focused; `-readonly` suppresses both the hover and focus affordances so the element always reads as plain inline text.\n * @modifier -readonly — Shown inline but not editable (no hover/focus affordance).\n * @a11y Give the editable element `role=\"textbox\"` and an accessible name (`aria-label`).\n * @example -canvas-rce -docs\n * ```html\n * <span class=\"pfx-in-place-edit\" contenteditable=\"true\" role=\"textbox\" aria-label=\"Project name\">Untitled</span>\n * ```\n * @related text-input — On focus it shows the same input chrome as a text input.\n * @demo self:in-place-edit\n * @example -automatica11y\n * ```html\n * <p><span id=\"audit-project-label\">Project name</span>: <span class=\"pfx-in-place-edit\" contenteditable=\"true\" role=\"textbox\" aria-labelledby=\"audit-project-label\">Untitled</span></p>\n * <p><span id=\"audit-project-locked-label\">Locked project name</span>: <span class=\"pfx-in-place-edit -readonly\" contenteditable=\"false\" role=\"textbox\" aria-readonly=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"audit-project-locked-label\">Published project</span></p>\n * ```\n */\n@scope (.pfx-in-place-edit) {\n  & {\n    display: inline-block;\n    min-inline-size: 2rem;\n    padding: var(--instui-spacing-space2xs) var(--instui-spacing-space-xs);\n    border: var(--instui-component-text-input-border-width) solid transparent;\n    border-radius: var(--instui-component-text-input-border-radius);\n    color: var(--instui-color-text-base);\n    font: inherit;\n    cursor: text;\n  }\n\n  /* Hover affordance: it's editable. */\n  &:hover {\n    background: var(--instui-color-background-muted);\n  }\n\n  /* Focus = edit mode: input chrome + the focus ring. */\n  &:focus {\n    background: var(--instui-component-text-input-background-color);\n    border-color: var(--instui-component-text-input-border-color);\n    outline: none;\n  }\n\n  &:focus-visible {\n    outline: var(--instui-focus-outline-width) var(--instui-focus-outline-style)\n      var(--instui-focus-outline-color);\n    outline-offset: var(--instui-focus-outline-offset);\n  }\n\n  &.-readonly {\n    cursor: default;\n  }\n\n  &.-readonly:hover {\n    background: transparent;\n  }\n}\n","canOfferSessionApproval":true,"fileEdits":[{"before":{"path":"/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/compo