,"id":"","summary":[{"text":"**Considering fixture changes**\n\nI need to assess the write fixture change since all five expansions were authorized by a human. I’m wondering if this could bypass any controls, as it modifies the audit test fixture. There's a concern that changing the examples might weaken the reliability of the tests, especially since one example covers all variants. However, it seems that this task is scoped properly and explicitly authorized, so it looks like I should proceed with the change.","type":"summary_text"}],"type":"reasoning"}]},"responses_message_status":"completed","phase":"final_answer","serverTools":{"provider":"openai-responses"},"apiCallId":"","outputTokens":92,"providerId":"copilot"}]},"id":"8740ce95-96da-4256-a494-18c03ed2bd4e","timestamp":"2026-10-28T21:04:18.885Z","parentId":"08e59b89-0984-437e-9ccc-b34de9321909"}
{"type":"permission.requested","data":{"requestId":"1ccfb46d-af54-4cb7-8798-0ab905bcfec4","permissionRequest":{"kind":"write","toolCallId":"custom_call_2vGqbMGQH3tDBqViVLzZvwhQ","intention":"Update file","fileName":"/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/list/members/item/item.css","diff":"\ndiff --git a/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/list/members/item/item.css b/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/list/members/item/item.css\nindex 0000000..0000000 100644\n--- a/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/list/members/item/item.css\n+++ b/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/list/members/item/item.css\n@@ -15,11 +15,12 @@\n  * }\n  * @example -automatica11y\n  * ```html\n- * <ul class=\"pfx-list\">\n- *   <li>First item</li>\n- *   <li>Second item</li>\n- *   <li>Third item</li>\n- * </ul>\n+ * <ul class=\"pfx-list -size-sm\"><li>Small first item</li><li>Small second item</li></ul>\n+ * <ul class=\"pfx-list -size-md\"><li>Medium first item</li><li>Medium second item</li></ul>\n+ * <ul class=\"pfx-list -size-lg\"><li>Large first item</li><li>Large second item</li></ul>\n+ * <ul class=\"pfx-list -delimiter-solid\"><li>Solid first item</li><li>Solid second item</li></ul>\n+ * <ul class=\"pfx-list -delimiter-dashed\"><li>Dashed first item</li><li>Dashed second item</li></ul>\n+ * <ol class=\"pfx-list -ordered\"><li>Ordered first item</li><li>Ordered second item</li></ol>\n  * ```\n  */\n \n","newFileContents":"/**\n * @component list.item\n * @memberOf list\n * @selector .pfx-list > li\n * @a11y Keep each item a direct `<li>` child of the list so it stays in the list's accessibility tree; delimiters and markers are visual only.\n * @summary A list item (InstUI `List.Item`).\n * @remarks The parent `list`'s `-size-sm`/`-size-lg`, `-ordered`, and `-delimiter-solid`/`-delimiter-dashed` modifiers restyle this member — see `list`'s own doc for thos