{"type":"hook.start","data":{"hookInvocationId":"4e99a258-11ee-4875-a6ee-881cc0ae4ab9","hookType":"postToolUse","input":{"sessionId":"049c1373-ecc6-4d66-bbea-f19e45c06453","timestamp":1793221460491,"cwd":"/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken","toolName":"apply_patch","toolArgs":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/checkbox/checkbox.css\n@@\n  * @example -automatica11y\n  * ```html\n- * <label class=\"pfx-checkbox --display-block --mb-sm\">\n- *   <input type=\"checkbox\" checked>Checkbox\n- * </label>\n- * <label class=\"pfx-checkbox -variant-toggle\">\n- *   <input type=\"checkbox\">Toggle\n- * </label>\n+ * <p><label class=\"pfx-checkbox\"><input type=\"checkbox\">Unchecked checkbox</label></p>\n+ * <p><label class=\"pfx-checkbox -label-placement-end\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked>Checked checkbox, label after</label></p>\n+ * <p><label class=\"pfx-checkbox -size-sm -label-placement-start\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked>Small checkbox, label before</label></p>\n+ * <p><label class=\"pfx-checkbox -size-lg -label-placement-top\"><input type=\"checkbox\">Large checkbox, label above</label></p>\n+ * <p><label class=\"pfx-checkbox\"><input id=\"audit-checkbox-mixed\" type=\"checkbox\">Partially selected checkbox</label></p>\n+ * <p><label class=\"pfx-checkbox\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled>Disabled unchecked checkbox</label></p>\n+ * <p><label class=\"pfx-checkbox\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled>Disabled checked checkbox</label></p>\n+ * <p><label class=\"pfx-checkbox -readonly\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled>Locked checkbox (disabled because native checkboxes have no readonly state)</label></p>\n+ * <p><label class=\"pfx-checkbox -invalid -required\"><input type=\"checkbox\" required aria-invalid=\"true\" aria-describedby=\"audit-checkbox-error\">Accept the terms (required)<span class=\"asterisk\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label></p>\n+ * <p id=\"audit-checkbox-error\">Accept the terms before continuing.</p>\n+ * <p><label class=\"pfx-checkbox -variant-toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\">Toggle off</label></p>\n+ * <p><label class=\"pfx-checkbox -variant-toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked>Toggle on</label></p>\n+ * <p><label class=\"pfx-checkbox -variant-toggle -size-sm\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked>Small toggle on</label></p>\n+ * <p><label class=\"pfx-checkbox -variant-toggle -size-lg\"><input type=\"checkbox\">Large toggle off</label></p>\n+ * <p><label class=\"pfx-checkbox -variant-toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled>Disabled toggle off</label></p>\n+ * <p><label class=\"pfx-checkbox -variant-toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled>Disabled toggle on</label></p>\n+ * <script>document.getElementById(\"audit-checkbox-mixed\").indeterminate = true;</script>\n*** Update File: /Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/radio/radio.css\n@@\n  * @example -automatica11y\n  * ```html\n- * <label class=\"pfx-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"r\" checked> Option A</label>\n+ * <fieldset>\n+ *   <legend>Standard radio sizes and states</legend>\n+ *   <p><label class=\"pfx-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"audit-radio-standard\" value=\"medium\" checked>Medium selected</label></p>\n+ *   <p><label class=\"pfx-radio -size-sm\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"audit-radio-standard\" value=\"small\">Small unselected</label></p>\n+ *   <p><label class=\"pfx-radio -size-lg\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"audit-radio-standard\" value=\"large\">Large unselected</label></p>\n+ *   <p><label class=\"pfx-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"audit-radio-standard\" value=\"disabled\" disabled>Disabled unselected</label></p>\n+ * </fieldset>\n+ * <fieldset>\n+ *   <legend>Locked radio selection (disabled because native radios have no readonly state)</legend>\n+ *   <p><label class=\"pfx-radio -readonly\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"audit-radio-locked\" value=\"locked\" checked disabled>Read-only selected</label></p>\n+ *   <p><label class=\"pfx-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"audit-radio-locked\" value=\"other\" disabled>Disabled unselected</label></p>\n+ * </fieldset>\n+ * <fieldset>\n+ *   <legend>Disabled selected radio</legend>\n+ *   <label class=\"pfx-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"audit-radio-disabled\" checked disabled>Disabled selected</label>\n+ * </fieldset>\n+ * <fieldset>\n+ *   <legend>Default toggle sizes and states</legend>\n+ *   <p><label class=\"pfx-radio -variant-toggle\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"audit-radio-toggle\" value=\"medium\" checked>Medium selected</label></p>\n+ *   <p><label class=\"pfx-radio -variant-toggle -size-sm\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"audit-radio-toggle\" value=\"small\">Small unselected</label></p>\n+ *   <p><label class=\"pfx-radio -variant-toggle -size-lg\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"audit-radio-toggle\" value=\"large\">Large unselected</label></p>\n+ *   <p><label class=\"pfx-radio -variant-toggle\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"audit-radio-toggle\" value=\"disabled\" disabled>Disabled unselected</label></p>\n+ * </fieldset>\n+ * <fieldset><legend>Neutral toggle</legend><label class=\"pfx-radio -variant-toggle -context-off\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"audit-radio-off\" checked>Neutral selected</label></fieldset>\n+ * <fieldset><legend>Success toggle</legend><label class=\"pfx-radio -variant-toggle -context-success\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"audit-radio-success\" checked>Success selected</label></fieldset>\n+ * <fieldset><legend>Warning toggle</legend><label class=\"pfx-radio -variant-toggle -context-warning\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"audit-radio-warning\" checked>Warning selected</label></fieldset>\n+ * <fieldset><legend>Danger toggle</legend><label class=\"pfx-radio -variant-toggle -context-danger\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"audit-radio-danger\" checked>Danger selected</label></fieldset>\n+ * <fieldset><legend>Disabled toggle selection</legend><label class=\"pfx-radio -variant-toggle\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"audit-radio-toggle-disabled\" checked disabled>Disabled selected</label></fieldset>\n*** Update File: /Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/tag/tag.css\n@@\n  * @example -automatica11y\n  * ```html\n- * <span class=\"pfx-tag -size-sm\">small</span>\n+ * <p><span class=\"pfx-tag -size-sm\">Small tag</span></p>\n+ * <p><span class=\"pfx-tag\">Medium tag</span></p>\n+ * <p><span class=\"pfx-tag -size-lg\">Large tag</span></p>\n+ * <p><button class=\"pfx-tag -inline -size-sm\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Remove small Biology tag\">Biology</button></p>\n+ * <p><button class=\"pfx-tag -inline\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Remove medium Chemistry tag\">Chemistry</button></p>\n+ * <p><button class=\"pfx-tag -inline -size-lg\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Remove large Physics tag\">Physics</button></p>\n+ * <p><span class=\"pfx-tag -readonly\">Read-only tag</span></p>\n+ * <p><span class=\"pfx-tag -inline -readonly\">Read-only inline tag</span></p>\n*** Update File: /Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/in-place-edit/in-place-edit.css\n@@\n  * @example -automatica11y\n  * ```html\n- * <span class=\"pfx-in-place-edit\" contenteditable=\"true\" role=\"textbox\" aria-label=\"Project name\">Untitled</span>\n+ * <p><span id=\"audit-project-label\">Project name</span>: <span class=\"pfx-in-place-edit\" contenteditable=\"true\" role=\"textbox\" aria-labelledby=\"audit-project-label\">Untitled</span></p>\n+ * <p><span id=\"audit-project-locked-label\">Locked project name</span>: <span class=\"pfx-in-place-edit -readonly\" contenteditable=\"false\" role=\"textbox\" aria-readonly=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"audit-project-locked-label\">Published project</span></p>\n*** Update File: /Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/components/file-drop/file-drop.css\n@@\n  * @example -automatica11y\n  * ```html\n- * <label class=\"pfx-file-drop\" id=\"fd\">\n- *   <span class=\"pfx-icon -icon-cloud-upload\"></span>\n- *   <div class=\"pfx-text\"><strong>Drag an image here</strong>, or click to browse.</div>\n- *   <div class=\"pfx-text -size-sm pfx-fg-muted\" id=\"fd-msg\">PNG or JPG up to 5&nbsp;MB.</div>\n- *   <input type=\"file\" id=\"fd-input\">\n+ * <label class=\"pfx-file-drop\">\n+ *   <span class=\"-icon-cloud-upload\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n+ *   <span id=\"audit-file-label\">Upload an image</span>\n+ *   <span id=\"audit-file-hint\">Choose a PNG or JPEG file, up to 5 MB.</span>\n+ *   <input type=\"file\" accept=\"image/png,image/jpeg\" aria-labelledby=\"audit-file-label\" aria-describedby=\"audit-file-hint\">\n+ * </label>\n+ * <label class=\"pfx-file-drop -hover\">\n+ *   <span id=\"audit-file-hover-label\">Upload while dragging a file</span>\n+ *   <span id=\"audit-file-hover-hint\">Drop the file here, or use the file picker.</span>\n+ *   <input type=\"file\" aria-labelledby=\"audit-file-hover-label\" aria-describedby=\"audit-file-hover-hint\">\n+ * </label>\n+ * <label class=\"pfx-file-drop -accepted\">\n+ *   <span id=\"audit-file-accepted-label\">Upload an acceptable image</span>\n+ *   <span id=\"audit-file-accepted-hint\">This file type is accepted: PNG or JPEG.</span>\n+ *   <input type=\"file\" accept=\"image/png,image/jpeg\" aria-labelledby=\"audit-file-accepted-label\" aria-describedby=\"audit-file-accepted-hint\">\n+ * </label>\n+ * <label class=\"pfx-file-drop -rejected\">\n+ *   <span id=\"audit-file-rejected-label\">Replace a rejected image</span>\n+ *   <span id=\"audit-file-error\">File rejected. Choose a PNG or JPEG file, up to 5 MB.</span>\n+ *   <input type=\"file\" accept=\"image/png,image/jpeg\" required aria-invalid=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"audit-file-rejected-label\" aria-describedby=\"audit-file-error\">\n  * </label>\n*** End Patch\n","toolResult":{"resultType":"success","textResultForLlm":"[copilot:elided textResultForLlm (449 bytes) - duplicated pre-hook tool-result field; canonical data remains in adjacent tool and s