{"type":"user.message","data":{"content":"Parsed CssDocEntry.modifiers carries modifier.alias.canonical (not description @alias) and modifier.pattern. I'll add metadata-derived guard that requires canonical visual color/size/variant/state modifier classes on matching component roots, skipping aliases/patterns. Flag any intentional exceptions with rationale. Please ensure data-a11y roots/triggers remain where harness needs them; root identifiers should remain unique. Guard tests now normalize pfx before checking IDs/ARIA for plugin records too.","transformedContent":"Parsed CssDocEntry.modifiers carries modifier.alias.canonical (not description @alias) and modifier.pattern. I'll add metadata-derived guard that requires canonical visual color/size/variant/state modifier classes on matching component roots, skipping aliases/patterns. Flag any intentional exceptions with rationale. Please ensure data-a11y roots/triggers remain where harness needs them; root identifiers should remain unique. Guard tests now normalize pfx before checking IDs/ARIA for plugin records too.","source":"agent-cf8db52f-0f27-4d51-8f45-3f9af32eb056","messageId":"8e17886e-99d7-4558-afe9-d2eb14a70fda","delivery":"steering","turnId":"12","interactionId":"dc991500-dd7c-4200-b23e-c4184be4a534","responsesReasoning":{"model":"gpt-6.1-sol","initialEffort":"medium","effort":"medium"}},"agentId":"049c1373-ecc6-4d66-bbea-f19e45c06453","id":"da1436e7-4af3-4a32-91b2-5606303fce5e","timestamp":"2026-10-28T21:04:20.595Z","parentId":"373f3fd6-4b17-4af6-893c-4e18cf7e1041"}
