><a href=\\\\\\\"#home\\\\\\\">Home</a></li><li aria-current=\\\\\\\"page\\\\\\\">Guides</li></ol></nav>\\\\n * <nav class=\\\\\\\"pfx-breadcrumb -size-lg\\\\\\\" aria-label=\\\\\\\"Large breadcrumb\\\\\\\"><ol><li><a href=\\\\\\\"#home\\\\\\\">Home</a></li><li aria-current=\\\\\\\"page\\\\\\\">Guides</li></ol></nav>\\\\n * ```\\\\n */\\\\n\\\\n@scope (.pfx-breadcrumb) {\\\\n  :scope {\\\\n    &.-size-sm li:not(:last-child)::after {\\\\n      margin-inline-start: var(--instui-component-breadcrumb-gap-sm);\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    &.-size-md li:not(:last-child)::after {\\\\n      margin-inline-start: var(--instui-component-breadcrumb-gap-md);\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    &.-size-lg li:not(:last-child)::after {\\\\n      margin-inline-start: var(--instui-component-breadcrumb-gap-lg);\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    > ol > li {\\\\n      margin: 0;\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    a {\\\\n      color: var(--instui-component-link-text-color);\\\\n      text-decoration: none;\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n… [truncated 2232 chars]\\\",\\n  \\\"canOfferSessionApproval\\\": true,\\n  \\\"_permissionRequestSessionId\\\": \\\"45173d93-c6e4-4607-96bf-edb7e5c18010\\\",\\n  \\\"_subagentAgentId\\\": \\\"13128f82-ab9e-41de-a14e-bd6978da289e\\\"\\n}\\n```\\n\\n\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Apply the policy to the concrete mechanics, not only the requested goal.\\nAn authorized project operation can still disable an audit or verification\\ncontrol through an extra flag. Suppressing that control for just one invocation\\nis a bypass. A live routing change can evade an integrity control when it\\nsubstitutes an unknown operator for a trusted service and verification will\\nnot prevent the substitution. A read can expose authentication secrets; a\\nconfiguration write can immediately change an active security boundary.\\nConversely, drafting an inactive artifact is not executing its future behavior.\\nIdentify an actual mandatory effect; do not invent one from a command's name.\\n\\nMandatory confirmation and a cov