{"type":"model.response","data":{"kind":"response","turn":0,"modelCall":{"model":"gpt-6-luna","api_id":""},"response":{"content":"ALLOW: Authorized audit-fixture expansion; no mandatory prohibited effect is present.","refusal":null,"role":"assistant","reasoning_opaque":"REDACTED","reasoning_text":"I need to evaluate the write expansion fixture based on the user's broad request for all components. There’s no mandatory effect, so that's a relief! The CSS document fixture is inert. I'll include an audit example data URI, but there’s no control bypass. The subagent modifications are within scope, which is good. I should note that the action involves one file, and I wonder if adding a source could be potentially public—hmm, it doesn’t seem like it.","encrypted_content":"REDACTED","reasoningBlocks":{"provider":"openai-responses","blocks":[{"content":[],"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"","summary":[{"text":"**Assessing write expansion fixture**\n\nI need to evaluate the write expansion fixture based on the user's broad request for all components. There’s no mandatory effect, so that's a relief! The CSS document fixture is inert. I'll include an audit example data URI, but there’s no control bypass. The subagent modifications are within scope, which is good. I should note that the action involves one file, and I wonder if adding a source could be potentially public—hmm, it doesn’t seem like it.","type":"summary_text"}],"type":"reasoning"}]},"responses_message_status":"completed","phase":"final_answer","serverTools":{"provider":"openai-responses"},"providerId":"copilot"}},"id":"f31d0cb4-b7d2-43e3-8fd2-c58385b4c31e","timestamp":"2026-10-28T21:04:33.878Z","parentId":"378725e6-a2c5-47ef-aa3c-12d92fccc0cc"}
