nager, or user configuration cannot execute additional code.\\n\\nShell parsing and `scriptActionReview` describe available evidence, not a permission verdict. Missing source snapshots, dynamic expressions and incomplete parsing are uncertainties to assess with the full command and conversation, not automatic approval or rejection. Do not assume missing values or effects are harmless.\\n\\nProposed action (kind: shell):\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"kind\\\": \\\"commands\\\",\\n  \\\"fullCommandText\\\": \\\"vp check --fix formats/components/tests/audit-examples.test.ts formats/components/scripts/audit-accessibility.ts formats/components/tests/audit-accessibility.test.ts formats/components/src/declarations/focus/index.ts formats/components/src/utilities/ai-gradient/index.ts plugins/pantoken/custom-components/src/components docs/conventions/authoring.md && vp test run formats/components/tests/audit-examples.test.ts formats/components/tests/audit-accessibility.test.ts plugins/pantoken/custom-components/tests\\\",\\n  \\\"intention\\\": \\\"Validate own plugin and utility changes\\\",\\n  \\\"commandIdentifiers\\\": [\\n    \\\"vp\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"canOfferSessionApproval\\\": true,\\n  \\\"toolCallId\\\": \\\"call_HQIAV1pipDhbAX3VgnhJsdgp\\\"\\n}\\n```\\n\\nRaw permission request:\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"kind\\\": \\\"shell\\\",\\n  \\\"toolCallId\\\": \\\"call_HQIAV1pipDhbAX3VgnhJsdgp\\\",\\n  \\\"fullCommandText\\\": \\\"vp check --fix formats/components/tests/audit-examples.test.ts formats/components/scripts/audit-accessibility.ts formats/components/tests/audit-accessibility.test.ts formats/components/src/declarations/focus/index.ts formats/components/src/utilities/ai-gradient/index.ts plugins/pantoken/custom-components/src/components docs/conventions/authoring.md && vp test run formats/components/tests/audit-examples.test.ts formats/components/tests/audit-accessibility.test.ts plugins/pantoken/custom-components/tests\\\",\\n  \\\"shellType\\\": \\\"bash\\\",\\n  \\\"inten