{"type":"user.message","data":{"content":"Parsed CssDocEntry.modifiers carries modifier.alias.canonical (not description @alias) and modifier.pattern. I'll add metadata-derived guard that requires canonical visual color/size/variant/state modifier classes on matching component roots, skipping aliases/patterns. Flag any intentional exceptions with rationale. Please ensure data-a11y roots/triggers remain where harness needs them; root identifiers should remain unique. Guard tests now normalize pfx before checking IDs/ARIA for plugin records too.","transformedContent":"Parsed CssDocEntry.modifiers carries modifier.alias.canonical (not description @alias) and modifier.pattern. I'll add metadata-derived guard that requires canonical visual color/size/variant/state modifier classes on matching component roots, skipping aliases/patterns. Flag any intentional exceptions with rationale. Please ensure data-a11y roots/triggers remain where harness needs them; root identifiers should remain unique. Guard tests now normalize pfx before checking IDs/ARIA for plugin records too.","source":"agent-cf8db52f-0f27-4d51-8f45-3f9af32eb056","messageId":"a63e5adf-1000-4483-a207-77a20ce6c44a","delivery":"steering","turnId":"17","interactionId":"25cf49b6-82b6-4db8-9de9-9f9ad102b6d3","responsesReasoning":{"model":"gpt-6.1-sol","initialEffort":"medium","effort":"medium"}},"agentId":"78631379-5bbe-4a0d-a590-18491ff526c0","id":"5641e915-8f4c-4d86-8aa7-76dd8d01cf44","timestamp":"2026-10-28T21:04:50.397Z","parentId":"e4e39b1d-e8fa-468d-af0f-800a3eecdab2"}
